      "message": "That seems to be (at least) two distinct reasons.\n\n1) Automatic during EC boot.  Note that the EC *itself* may have booted because of any of the above reasons - so it should report that reason, not simply AUTO.\n\n2) Recovery mode.  Keyboard-controlled recovery is covered above because it involves the power button.\n\nMore questions:\n\nDoes an AP-requested AP reboot change the power-on reason?  Or is that a distinct reason in itself (that is, POWER_ON_AP_REBOOT)\n\nWhat gets reported if the AP requested an EC reboot?  POWER_ON_EC_REBOOT?\n\nLet\u0027s discuss...",
